[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/comments/5432883305","html_url":"https://github.com/marin-community/marin/issues/6443#issuecomment-5432883305","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/6443","id":5432883305,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLj5faM8AAAABQ9M4aQ","user":{"login":"ClassicLarry","id":42926649,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTI2NjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42926649?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry","html_url":"https://github.com/ClassicLarry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T00:49:37Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T00:49:37Z","body":"🤖 Results for the two Gate-1 runs, which were never posted here. Both finished; W&B under `marin_moe`.\n\n| scale | run | paloma macro | May-Recipe baseline | tok/s |\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| d512 | [moe_may_compute_opt_d512_ep1_alternate_dense_moe](https://wandb.ai/marin-community/marin_moe/runs/moe_may_compute_opt_d512_ep1_alternate_dense_moe) | 3.5486 | 3.5438 (+0.0048) | 383,363 |\n| d768 | [moe_may_compute_opt_d768_ep1_alternate_dense_moe](https://wandb.ai/marin-community/marin_moe/runs/moe_may_compute_opt_d768_ep1_alternate_dense_moe) | 3.2236 | 3.2330 (−0.0094) | 272,894 |\n\nQuality is a wash: marginally worse at d512, marginally better at d768, both within eval noise. Alternating dense/MoE blocks gave no consistent quality gain over the compute-optimal May Recipe baseline at either scale.\n\nTokens per second (from `throughput/examples_per_second` × 4096 seq len):\n\n| scale | alternating (v5p-8) | baseline (v4-32) |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| d512 | 383,363 | 530,704 |\n| d768 | 272,894 | 357,696 |\n\nThe variant is slower in raw tok/s, but the baseline was measured on v4-32 while these ran on v5p-8, so the raw comparison conflates hardware with algorithm, as the plan noted. With quality neutral and no throughput advantage, the variant does not clear Gate 1 (effective speedup > 1 at both scales).\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/comments/5432883305/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/comments/5432929722","html_url":"https://github.com/marin-community/marin/issues/6443#issuecomment-5432929722","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/6443","id":5432929722,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLj5faM8AAAABQ9Ptug","user":{"login":"ClassicLarry","id":42926649,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTI2NjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42926649?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry","html_url":"https://github.com/ClassicLarry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ClassicLarry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T00:56:36Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T00:56:36Z","body":"Small scale iirc alternating is about 20% better MFU. but unclear yet how this scales up, both in terms of quality and MFU.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/comments/5432929722/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]